Both modern`exports` and`imports` resolution use the following conditions array passed to`resolve.imports()` and`resolve.exports()`:

- `'svelte'`: Svelte-specific entry points
- `'module'`: ESM entry points
- `'browser'`: Browser-compatible entry points
- `'development'`: Development builds (not production)
