   - `GET /@cawco/sheet?file=` serves the shell (app.html/index.html markup with inline scripts dropped and placeholders stripped);
   - global CSS comes from the root module's style imports;
   - the entry is the virtual `/@id/__x00__cawco:sheet/<file>.js`;
   - mount adapters for Svelte, Vue, React, Solid and Preact;
   - each frame carries `data-cawco-story` and `data-cawco-source`;
   - HMR re-mounts on a story-file edit;
